# R-4 evidence: `see #id contains "..."` must read TextField/TextFormField
# content via the underlying EditableText, not just Text/RichText widgets.

before each test
  restart the app

test "text field content is readable via contains check"
  wait until "Login to NECT" appears
  type "probe-r4-evidence@test.com" into #login_email_field
  see #login_email_field contains "probe-r4-evidence@test.com"
  take a screenshot called "r4_evidence_textfield_contains"
